Attribution for blocks.mjs
==========================

This is a PC Minecraft 1.21.1 adaptation of prismarine-block 1.23.0
(index.js and blockEntity.js), including biome fallback behavior from
prismarine-biome 1.4.0 (index.js), NBT builders and simplification from
prismarine-nbt 2.8.0 (nbt.js), and the sign plain-text component parser,
formatter, sanitizer and string nesting from prismarine-chat 1.13.0
(index.js, format.js and MessageBuilder.js).

Changes remove other Minecraft versions, Bedrock support, dynamic requires,
binary NBT I/O, and chat functionality not observable through Block. Registry
data is supplied by the build. This module does not expose ChatMessage or an
NBT serialization API.

Upstream repositories:
https://github.com/PrismarineJS/prismarine-block
https://github.com/PrismarineJS/prismarine-biome
https://github.com/PrismarineJS/prismarine-nbt
https://github.com/PrismarineJS/prismarine-chat

The installed prismarine-block, prismarine-biome and prismarine-nbt packages
contain MIT declarations in package.json but no LICENSE file. Their original
package metadata, including author and license declarations, is retained
verbatim below. No copyright owner or year has been invented for them.
The prismarine-chat license is reproduced verbatim here:

